      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:03</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">No, that&#x27;s okay. Only I&#x27;ll be the only one listening to it.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:08</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Well, I&#x27;ve forgotten where I met him.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:15</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">But what? Is it on again?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:18</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah, that&#x27;s okay. It doesn&#x27;t matter. Okay, so court-martialed - what does that exactly mean?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:25</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Oh my god.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:29</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">What happened?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:30</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">They cut me out of flying. I was court-martialed not to fly.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:39</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So then I was in a gunnery school in Las Vegas, shooting snakes that came out of the ground. While I was there—</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:56</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Is that actually what were supposed to do? That.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:58</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">That was a gunnery school.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">00:59</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:05</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So in the meantime, a lot of fellows were coming into that gunnery school, and I found an article. Because I was mostly in the office working, I found an article that told me how I could become a liaison pilot.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:28</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Uh-huh.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:29</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So I applied for it. I was accepted. I was surprised.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:35</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">I was surprised. So you could do that even though you had been court-martialed and weren&#x27;t supposed to.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:42</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yes.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:44</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So when you got court martialed and you weren&#x27;t supposed to fly, like what were you.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:44</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">[Unclear]</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:49</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Were you... You were just kind of doing the gunnery thing in the meantime? Like, were you trying to.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:53</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Figure out where you were going to go next? They were sending you to school until somebody needed you someplace.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">01:59</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:02</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So in the meantime, while I&#x27;m going to gunnery school, this thing shows up. They&#x27;re looking for liaison pilots to train.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:14</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Do you think if you hadn&#x27;t been court-martialed and you were still where you were, learning to fly—</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:21</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">The court-martial was kind of a fancy way of putting it in to scare you.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:25</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Uh.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:27</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:28</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">But actually, it had no bearing, because as soon as I applied for it, I already had some flying time, and I was a pilot before. They couldn&#x27;t take away what I already had.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:44</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay. So do you think you would have been sent over to Europe had you stayed where you were?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:45</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:51</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Or is there there was oh you don&#x27;t know.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:51</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Oh, I don&#x27;t know. was... Oh,.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:53</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">02:55</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">All of a sudden, a letter comes from someplace around Philadelphia. It said I should go to Georgia to take flying lessons in a [B-75 or B-25 - unclear]. That was a killer of an airplane.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">03:22</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">What do you mean by that?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">03:24</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">It was hard to fly.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">03:25</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Why? What do you mean by that - it was a killer of an airplane?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">03:39</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">And after I applied over there, I was sent there. I had to go see a general, but the papers were already there. The guy says, &#x27;Why are you here when you can&#x27;t fly?&#x27; I said, &#x27;They can&#x27;t take my flying away.&#x27; He says, &#x27;Well, what do you want to do?&#x27; I said, &#x27;Well, this kind of flying, I think it&#x27;s pretty safe.&#x27; And he says, &#x27;Well, in this country it is. Overseas, would you follow the law?&#x27; I said, &#x27;Yeah.&#x27;</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:30</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So I was supposed to go to the Arab countries, like where they were fighting then, when I finished.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:37</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:40</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">That was a long course. That was about four months flying.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:45</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So wait, you told the guy - the general - that you—</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:45</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:48</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">—could still fly because they couldn&#x27;t take that away.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:51</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah. And he says to me, &#x27;All right, I&#x27;ll accept you.&#x27;</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:51</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay. Then he said that&#x27;s fine. Or okay.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">04:59</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">&#x27;You&#x27;re a pilot. That&#x27;ll be easier to train you,&#x27; and this and that and those and these. He said, &#x27;So you don&#x27;t have to go for this course.&#x27; I said I didn&#x27;t care for it. I didn&#x27;t know what this course consisted of, but when I saw what it was, I didn&#x27;t care for it. He said, &#x27;You&#x27;re doing the right thing. You are the type of pilot we are looking for - safety.&#x27;</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">05:30</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay. So you just wanted to deal with safety.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">05:39</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So you could have gone over to where they were fighting the war then, but you did not get there.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">05:47</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Well, I was scheduled to go there. But every time they scheduled us, it was getting toward the end of the war. And then when they scheduled us, we would go to the shipping area where we were supposed to ship from, in [unclear], Georgia. So they—</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">06:17</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Hold on one second. So, were supposed to go to the Arab countries, but every time you were supposed to go, it kept getting towards the end of the war, so it was, like, or put off.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">06:26</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">06:30</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">It didn&#x27;t matter, because they only picked so many men, and I never fit the category. I was a little too old.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">06:44</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">How old were you?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">06:51</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">[Unclear background speech]</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">06:59</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So, they sent me, uh….</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">07:03</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">[Unclear background speech]</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">07:06</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah. I went there with a guy who was a sergeant. When he got there, he took off to see his girlfriend someplace in Kentucky. He took off and never came back. They brought him back as a prisoner.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">07:33</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">07:33</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">The MPs caught him, and I took over the studies over there.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">07:51</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">I was running that school there, and that was about the time the war ended.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">07:58</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">[Unclear background speech]</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">07:59</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">When you were studying at the school in Oklahoma?</div>
      <div class="timestamp">08:25</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So, that&#x27;s it? That&#x27;s the war?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">08:27</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">As far as I was concerned.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">08:29</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay. Well, I&#x27;ve got some more questions for you. That, that was, that was really good. Um, did you enjoy being in the Army?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">08:46</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Well, I didn&#x27;t enjoy it, but they had to be, so I was there. Okay. They always sent you to a different place, from one place to another, hoping to fit in. But I fit, the best part I fit was, so far, there&#x27;s a place in Oklahoma.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">09:10</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So, is that why you stayed there? So, once they found someplace you.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">09:13</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">09:26</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Now, when you say fit, do you mean, like, fit in, like, with the rest of the people, or what you were learning there, or what? You.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">09:35</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Mean fit? Yeah. Well, I, I was a pilot to begin with, and it was just a matter of fitting a category.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">09:49</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Of what kind of.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">09:50</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">I was a liaison pilot. I was supposed to follow instructions. I would teach people how to identify objects to bomb or shoot up.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">10:23</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So, as you&#x27;re flying, you tell someone else where to shoot, or bomb. Is that right?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">10:28</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah. Either we were supposed to carry out wounded soldiers, or different things we had to do. We were more of a humanitarian enterprise.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">10:43</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Why? Why is that again? Why?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">10:46</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">We were more like a humanitarian enterprise. Mm-hmm.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">10:51</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Why how come? What would it why why do you say that?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">10:54</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Why do you say that? We were supposed to help the Army, or anybody that needed us. We were supposed to help them identify objects to bomb, all kinds of different things. Okay.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">11:20</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So, when you said fit, you meant, like, what kind of pilot? That&#x27;s what you meant? Like, you finally found your fit in being.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">11:30</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah, that is that.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">11:35</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Is it... Wait, no, I&#x27;m... So, that&#x27;s where you... You finally were a liaison pilot when you went to Oklahoma, right? Yeah. Okay. You weren&#x27;t a liaison pilot anywhere else?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">11:47</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">No.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">11:48</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">11:54</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Graduated to school there in Oklahoma and stayed. Of course, staying in the Army in one place too long was never an occurrence.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">12:11</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">It was never what?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">12:12</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">It never was an occurrence being too long in one place. If they needed you, you fit the category, that&#x27;s where you went. Did.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">12:28</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">You... So, you didn&#x27;t like the Army lifestyle very much either?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">12:33</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">[Unclear background speech]</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">12:33</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">No, I wasn&#x27;t much of an army person.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">12:42</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">And the treatment I got with the National Guard, that taught... That taught me that everything is for the buck.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">13:17</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Emotionally, how was it... What was it like to be in the Army?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">13:24</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Emotionally? Well, it was a way of life.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">13:30</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So, just got used to it and... If they.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">13:34</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Told you to do something, you did it.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">13:40</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Most of the officers didn&#x27;t know what to do at the beginning.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">13:52</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">How was... When you first got there, was the transition pretty hard?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">13:57</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">What Oklahoma?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">13:58</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">No. Well, mean, just got... In Hawaii. Yeah, when you first got there, period, was it... How was the transition?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:04</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Yeah, it wasn&#x27;t very good. Emotionally I didn&#x27;t care for him.</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:17</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Everybody was buttering themselves.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:20</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Oh, yeah.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:31</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay. Now, I like this story. This is going to be one of the most important things in my paper. When you went AWOL to marry Grandma - what does AWOL mean again?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:45</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Absent without leave.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:51</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">[Unclear background speech]</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:53</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">So you just chose to kind of take off. How long did—</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:57</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">[Unclear background speech]</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">14:58</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">They told me to record a certain day in.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">15:03</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Oklahoma. So you were in Las Vegas. What year was this - the year you got married?</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">15:07</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Married? I was in, uh... Las Vegas Gunnery.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Carrie Gabaree (Tarasuk)</div>
      <div class="timestamp">15:11</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">15:12</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Okay. They picked out certain guys, and when the guys figured who they got to be, the guy that was going to take them, there was this guy... I forget his name. But anyway, he was a sergeant. I was supposed to be his assistant.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Josephine Mendygral</div>
      <div class="timestamp">15:33</div>
      <div class="transcript-line">Because I knew what I was talking about. So,.</div>
      <div class="speaker">Walter Mendygral</div>
